# Reproducibility and tests

## Backend
- Prefer Testcontainers integration tests for persistence and migrations.
- Minimum: 1 integration test per vertical slice verifying that Flyway ran and the main repository/service works.
- Unit tests for domain rules when rules exist (statuses, validation, calculations).

## UI
- UI must consume OpenAPI-generated client/types (no manual duplicate DTOs when generation exists).
- Keep API base URL configurable and documented.

## Logs
- If you run commands, save output to files under `logs/` and update docs accordingly.
